{
  "_about": "Suggested monster stand spots for the built-in camera pictures in nightmare/assets/scenes/ (1824 x 1026). x, y, h use the game's monsters[].poses convention: fractions of the camera feed box, which is exactly the picture (fitPicture keeps 1824 x 1026; camFeedBox draws it at W*CAM_ZOOM x H*CAM_ZOOM = 1824 x 1026 screen px). x = middle of the body, y = where the feet are (the bottom of the sprite), h = sprite height / picture height for a 1.9 m figure. Only y 0.061 .. 0.939 is ever on screen (the box is shifted up 63 px) and the feed pans 224 px sideways, so keep x within about 0.07 .. 0.93. The sprite fades out over its bottom 28 % (softFrame), so the feet may sit a little lower (y + 0.01..0.03) if the legs look short. h_of_y gives the height for feet anywhere on that room's main floor: h = k * (y - y_horizon).",
  "picture": [
    1824,
    1026
  ],
